  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>为<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴达武器库</a>添加基于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">碧空传说</a>主题的新武器。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>支持的材料：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>镁铝榴石</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蓝晶石</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>透辉石</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>紫锂辉石</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>地平石</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>灼热</strong> </span>- 使敌人着火3秒</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>计划更新：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">支持1.19.2版本</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">支持1.18.2版本</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">修复所有<a href=\"https://github.com/KreloX/SpartanSkies/issues?q=is:open is:issue label:bug\" rel=\"nofollow\">漏洞</a></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252fkreloxkinetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://1drv.ms/i/c/6bf544900f9867ae/IQR3yxNMtle9S4RxniPeeGgMAVrcnQ4U65DGA1uiSdBUIbE?width=837&amp;height=80&amp;n=-1\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"> </a></p>",
